---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';import resources from '../data/resources.json';const documents=resources.filter(d=>d.source==='/resource-policy-library/');
---
<SiteLayout title="Parent Policies & Resources | Growing Kids" description="Read Growing Kids family policies, the parent handbook and practical resources about learning, play and child care." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Policies and Resources',path:'/resource-policy-library/'}]}><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Helpful Details For Everyday Care</h1><p class="intro">Find Growing Kids’ published parent handbook, CCTV and illness policies and resources about learning and family life. Your center can explain how a policy relates to your child.</p></div></section><section class="section cream"><div class="wrap"><h2>Policies and documents</h2><ul class="link-list">{documents.slice(0,3).map(d=><li><a href={d.path}>{d.title} · PDF</a></li>)}</ul><p>These documents are retained from the current Growing Kids resource library. Ask your director whether a newer version is available.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>Parent resource library</h2><ul class="resource-list">{documents.slice(3).map(d=><li><a href={d.path}>{d.title} · PDF</a></li>)}</ul><p><a href="/parent-resources-request/">Suggest a resource update</a> · <a href="/feedback/">Share feedback</a></p><h2>Program forms</h2><ul class="link-list">{resources.filter(d=>d.source.startsWith('/programs/')).map(d=><li><a href={d.path}>{d.title} · PDF</a></li>)}</ul><p><a href="/faqs/">Common questions</a> · <a href="/school-closings/">School closing updates</a> · <a href="/request-information/">Ask our team</a></p></div></section></SiteLayout>
